@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Situs & Layout
GET {{@base}}/public/site

###
GET {{@base}}/public/homepage

###
GET {{@base}}/public/sitemap

### Kategori
GET {{@base}}/public/categories

###
GET {{@base}}/public/categories/kajian

### Artikel
GET {{@base}}/public/articles

###
GET {{@base}}/public/articles?category=kajian&page=1&per_page=12

###
GET {{@base}}/public/articles/adab-menuntut-ilmu

###
GET {{@base}}/public/articles/menjaga-keikhlasan-dalam-menuntut-ilmu-0

### Artikel - Trending & Popular
GET {{@base}}/public/articles/trending?window=day&limit=5

###
GET {{@base}}/public/articles/popular?days=30&limit=5

### View beacon (track article view)
POST {{@base}}/public/articles/1/view

### Slug redirect (jika slug sudah berubah)
GET {{@base}}/public/articles/old-slug

### Preview draft (dengan token dari admin)
GET {{@base}}/public/articles/draft-slug?preview=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Pencarian
GET {{@base}}/public/search?q=keikhlasan&page=1

###
GET {{@base}}/public/search?q=keiklasan

### Tag
GET {{@base}}/public/tags

###
GET {{@base}}/public/tags?popular=true&limit=10

###
GET {{@base}}/public/tags/akhlak

### Penulis
GET {{@base}}/public/authors/ust-ahmad-fauzi

### Event
GET {{@base}}/public/events?when=upcoming

###
GET {{@base}}/public/events?when=past&page=1

###
GET {{@base}}/public/events?month=2026-09

###
GET {{@base}}/public/events/kajian-fiqih-september

### Alumni
GET {{@base}}/public/alumni?featured=true&page=1

###
GET {{@base}}/public/alumni/ahmad-dahlan

### Video
GET {{@base}}/public/videos?page=1

###
GET {{@base}}/public/videos/pengalaman-dakwah

### Pages
GET {{@base}}/public/pages/profil-yayasan

### Snippets
GET {{@base}}/public/snippets?type=faq

###
GET {{@base}}/public/snippets?type=announcement
